    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Unused set-up routine of the sample player: nothing calls it. It stops the CIA1 timers, sets sfx_sample_ptr = $0804 and sfx_sample_end = $0a04, clears the SID registers and sets sfx_volume = 15. Then it starts timer A (latch 8, continuous) and timer B (latch $0101, one-shot, counts timer A), with the timer B IRQ on."}
